{"title": "Caravan Strongbox", "pageid": 8388, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Caravan_Strongbox", "categories": ["Containers", "Story items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-story\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Common_Chest_A_Faded.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Common_Chest_A_Faded.webp/300px-Common_Chest_A_Faded.webp, /w/images/d/d0/Common_Chest_A_Faded.webp 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Caravan Strongbox image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Common_Chest_A_Faded.webp/300px-Common_Chest_A_Faded.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Common_Chest_A_Faded.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #FF5901 ;\">Caravan Strongbox</span></a> is a container found during the quest <a href=\"/wiki/Find_the_Missing_Shipment\" title=\"Find the Missing Shipment\">Find the Missing Shipment</a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>A bloody handprint, still sticky to the touch, wraps around the iron handle of this heavy oak box, kept closed by a large iron lock.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Containers\" title=\"Containers\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Containers_Icon.png/25px-Containers_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c2/Containers_Icon.png/38px-Containers_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c2/Containers_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Containers\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Containers_Icon.png/25px-Containers_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c2/Containers_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Containers\" title=\"Containers\">Containers</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Story Item\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #FF5901 ;\">Story Item</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 10 kg (20 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 10 kg (20 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 1 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  1  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-5a7ee8e8795bae23END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-e9982df058084383END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">S_PLA_ZhentShipment_Chest</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_PLA_ZhentShipment_Chest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_PLA_ZhentShipment_Chest\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">fc3f4359-ec62-4cbf-8756-ecb9780c34e8</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:fc3f4359-ec62-4cbf-8756-ecb9780c34e8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:fc3f4359-ec62-4cbf-8756-ecb9780c34e8\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Sturdy\"> Condition: Sturdy </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sturdy_(Condition)\" title=\"Sturdy (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sturdy\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/32/Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sturdy_(Condition)\" title=\"Sturdy (Condition)\">Sturdy</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>This material is rather strong. Only a hit that deals at least 10 damage can damage it.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Act 1\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Risen_Road#Cave\" title=\"The Risen Road\">Risen Road Cave</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;39&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;628</span></li></ul>\n<p>Act 3\n</p>\n<ul><li>In the <a href=\"/wiki/Guildhall\" title=\"Guildhall\">Guildhall</a> carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slick_Inatra\" title=\"Slick Inatra\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_Slick_Inatra.png/25px-Portrait_Slick_Inatra.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_Slick_Inatra.png/38px-Portrait_Slick_Inatra.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_Slick_Inatra.png/50px-Portrait_Slick_Inatra.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slick Inatra\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_Slick_Inatra.png/25px-Portrait_Slick_Inatra.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c6/Portrait_Slick_Inatra.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Slick_Inatra\" title=\"Slick Inatra\">Slick Inatra</a>. Can be pickpocketed or looted off her corpse.</li></ul>\n</div>      \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Passive_features\">Passive features</span></h2>\n<p>Caravan Strongbox has 50 <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\">hit points</a>.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width: 62%;\">\n<caption>Resistances</caption>\n<tbody><tr><td><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">Piercing</span></a></td><td>Resistant</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slashing\" title=\"Slashing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slashing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Slashing\" title=\"Slashing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-slashing\">Slashing</span></a></td><td>Resistant</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a></td><td>Resistant</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poison\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-poison\">Poison</span></a></td><td>Immune</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psychic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">Psychic</span></a></td><td>Immune</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Radiant\" title=\"Radiant\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Radiant\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Radiant\" title=\"Radiant\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-radiant\">Radiant</span></a></td><td>Resistant</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<div class=\"notebegin\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Act_One\">Act One</span></h3>\n<ul><li>If unopened, can be delivered to the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Zhentarim\" title=\"Zhentarim\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ee/Portrait_Zhentarim.png/22px-Portrait_Zhentarim.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ee/Portrait_Zhentarim.png/33px-Portrait_Zhentarim.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ee/Portrait_Zhentarim.png/44px-Portrait_Zhentarim.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Zhentarim\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ee/Portrait_Zhentarim.png/22px-Portrait_Zhentarim.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ee/Portrait_Zhentarim.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Zhentarim\" title=\"Zhentarim\">Zhentarim</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Zhentarim_Hideout\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Zhentarim Hideout\">Zhentarim Hideout</a> for the quest <a href=\"/wiki/Find_the_Missing_Shipment\" title=\"Find the Missing Shipment\">Find the Missing Shipment</a> to unlock the special stock of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Brem\" title=\"Brem\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/Portrait_Brem.png/25px-Portrait_Brem.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/Portrait_Brem.png/38px-Portrait_Brem.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/Portrait_Brem.png/50px-Portrait_Brem.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Brem\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/Portrait_Brem.png/25px-Portrait_Brem.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2b/Portrait_Brem.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Brem\" title=\"Brem\">Brem</a> the trader.</li>\n<li>If the Caravan Strongbox is delivered to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Zarys\" title=\"Zarys\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Portrait_Zarys.png/25px-Portrait_Zarys.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Portrait_Zarys.png/38px-Portrait_Zarys.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Portrait_Zarys.png/50px-Portrait_Zarys.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Zarys\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Portrait_Zarys.png/25px-Portrait_Zarys.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2f/Portrait_Zarys.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Zarys\" title=\"Zarys\">Zarys</a>, it can be stolen back immediately or looted from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slick_Inatra\" title=\"Slick Inatra\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_Slick_Inatra.png/25px-Portrait_Slick_Inatra.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_Slick_Inatra.png/38px-Portrait_Slick_Inatra.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_Slick_Inatra.png/50px-Portrait_Slick_Inatra.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slick Inatra\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_Slick_Inatra.png/25px-Portrait_Slick_Inatra.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c6/Portrait_Slick_Inatra.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Slick_Inatra\" title=\"Slick Inatra\">Slick Inatra</a>; the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Iron_Flask\" title=\"Iron Flask\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Iron_Flask_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Iron_Flask_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Iron_Flask_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Iron_Flask_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Iron_Flask_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Iron_Flask_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Iron_Flask_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Iron_Flask_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b5/Iron_Flask_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Iron_Flask\" title=\"Iron Flask\">Iron Flask</a> will still be inside.\n<ul><li>Multiple players have reported being unable to steal the strongbox back from Zarys once it is delivered to her, but this result does not manifest in an unmodified version of the game, at any <a href=\"/wiki/Difficulty\" title=\"Difficulty\">difficulty</a> level.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Act_Three\">Act Three</span></h3>\n<ul><li>If the caravan strongbox is delivered, it can be found again in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Three\" title=\"Act Three\">Act Three</a> by pickpocketing <a href=\"/wiki/Slick_Inatra\" title=\"Slick Inatra\">Slick Inatra</a> at the <a href=\"/wiki/Guildhall\" title=\"Guildhall\">Guildhall</a> or looting her corpse. The <a href=\"/wiki/Iron_Flask\" title=\"Iron Flask\"><span style=\"color: #FF5901 ;\">Iron Flask</span></a> will still be inside.</li>\n<li>If not turned in during Act One, it can be turned in to Slick Inatra in the Guildhall, for 976gp and no other reward.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195618\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.099 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.104 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4851/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 51172/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10819/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 4/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.020/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1207455/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   81.88